 "text": "Hello, how are things going? Plenty of laptops have swappable batteries, and some even come with two. Swap the pads with cheap laptop ones. Not on the go, but at home before a flight. A cheap laptop stand and cheap keyboard cover make a proper pad easy. Yes, look for laptops with a full size keyboard, especially the space bar. That's where most of the difference is. Look for ones with separate number rows, and a short travel distance. That makes them much easier on your fingers.",
